@alife-records 1

node vp_1028.VQ_HOUSE_BATH
  t.any.1 Water for the road dirt.. paint spots are permanent
  t.any.2 Which towel can stand a work coat?
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1028.VQ_HOUSE_CHAIR
  t.any.1 I'll check the coat for loose metal first
  t.any.2 Good chair can stay good.. show me the other one
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1028.VQ_HOUSE_CHORES
  t.any.1 Let me check a sticky latch.. no promise till I've seen it
  t.any.2 Something small.. not repainting the house for a slice of bread
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1028.VQ_HOUSE_KITCHEN
  t.any.1 Anything that travels.. don't light a stove on my account
  t.any.2 A wrapping rather than a plate if you can spare one
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1028.VQ_HOUSE_PRAYER
  t.any.1 Could use a minute.. no need to join me
  t.any.2 Alma would ask for the living by name.. I'll start there
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1028.VQ_HOUSE_RADIO
  t.any.1 Guard traffic if there's any.. ordinary station otherwise
  t.any.2 Leave the dial where a voice was.. don't chase every crackle
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1028.VQ_HOUSE_SHELF
  t.any.1 Diagrams or hymns.. depends which trouble I'm putting off
  t.any.2 Won't pull anything apart just because it's a repair book
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1028.VQ_HOUSE_WELCOME
  t.any.1 Coat can stay on till you show me where the tools go
  t.any.2 Won't leave paint on your chair.. it dried years ago
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1028.VQ_NOW_CARRYING
  gate.rule trust>=10
  t.any.1 Wrench and choir clipping.. took Earl's socket tin too though he assigned it to Lorna.. called it borrowed and never brought it back
  fx.1 reveal f_tin
  fx.2 set flag:tin_told
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1028.VQ_NOW_CARRYING.d
  t.any.1 Gray coat doesn't hold anything that could help you
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1028.VQ_NOW_CARRYING.d2
  t.any.1 Pockets stay closed.. that wasn't permission
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1028.VQ_NOW_DRINK
  t.lo.1 Sometimes.. don't turn it into a church committee
  t.mid.1 More evenings than I liked to count.. never while painting
  t.hi.1 Drinking made the room quieter.. never made the next morning easier
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1028.VQ_NOW_HELP
  t.any.1 Can look at a hinge.. paint's less useful with people fleeing houses
  t.any.2 Metal fittings yes.. engines need somebody with more than this wrench
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1028.VQ_NOW_HUNGRY
  t.lo.1 Not empty yet.. came asking before it got that far
  t.lo.2 Could use food for the road rather than a whole supper
  t.mid.1 Want something that fits this coat.. paint pocket's cleaner than it looks
  t.hi.1 Yes.. packing food isn't admitting the road beat me
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1028.VQ_NOW_HURT
  t.any.1 Old garage aches.. you'd have to look for anything newer
  t.any.2 Coat weighs more by evening.. that's not something gauze fixes
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1028.VQ_NOW_PLAN
  t.any.1 Find where the Guard's taking questions.. carry food until then
  t.any.2 Can't stay parked like Vern's unfinished sedan
  t.any.3 Need to choose a direction I can manage, not the one that sounds brave
  t.any.4 I'm thinking it through. Don't hold your own plans up for mine
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1028.VQ_NOW_SICK
  t.any.1 A little unsteady.. wouldn't call myself a doctor over it
  t.any.2 Been poor company since leaving the garage.. food may help some of that
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1028.VQ_NOW_STAY
  t.any.1 Enough time to stop walking into my own coat hem
  t.any.2 Not asking for your spare room.. just a pause
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1028.VQ_NOW_THIRSTY
  t.any.1 Water.. don't fancy anything sweet
  t.any.2 A little's plenty.. can ask again if I'm still thirsty
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1028.VQ_NOW_TRUST
  t.lo.1 Dry fit.. haven't put weight on it yet
  t.mid.1 Less need to defend this wrench.. doesn't mean I'd lend it down the road
  t.hi.1 Could leave the wrench out of reach awhile.. that's my answer
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1028.VQ_NOW_WANT
  t.any.1 Food to carry.. that's the request
  t.any.2 Bread before anything for the wrench or coat
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1028.VQ_OFFER_ALCOHOL
  t.any.1 Water this time.. don't want to lose the road again
  t.any.2 Keep the bottle closed a minute.. let me decide without it poured
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1028.VQ_OFFER_BOOK
  t.any.1 A hymn book if you have one.. pictures of cars will do otherwise
  t.any.2 Lending needs a return plan.. let's make one before I take it
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1028.VQ_OFFER_FOOD
  t.any.1 Something to wrap.. leave the runs on my coat alone
  t.any.2 Yes.. don't bring out your last tin because I asked
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1028.VQ_OFFER_TOOL
  t.any.1 Keep the factory edge on a good tool.. I'll use the worn one
  t.any.2 Lend it here in the room.. no need to trust it down the road
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1028.VQ_PAST_BOSS
  t.any.1 Vern Meeks.. let the work answer anybody asking if I could do it
  t.any.2 Kept my paint cards after saying they were clutter.. caught him using them
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1028.VQ_PAST_CHURCH
  gate.rule trust>=40 & alone & flag:school_told
  t.any.1 Wednesday study.. put my money in collection envelopes for Lorna when hers went missing at home.. left my name off.. church let her believe somebody else had noticed
  fx.1 reveal f_collection
  fx.2 set flag:collection_told
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1028.VQ_PAST_CHURCH.d
  t.any.1 Counted the collection.. sang the low part
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1028.VQ_PAST_CHURCH.d2
  t.any.1 Other people's envelopes stay their business
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1028.VQ_PAST_DAYONE
  t.any.1 Mixing gray.. man came in with his car door open and left it that way
  t.any.2 Vern thought it was a road accident.. then the shouting passed our window
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1028.VQ_PAST_FAMILY
  gate.rule trust>=55 & alone & flag:collection_told
  t.any.1 Said family was waiting.. no meeting arranged.. Lorna hasn't answered since our quarrel years ago.. saying somebody expects me gets strangers to let me go
  cb.1 Still don't know where Lorna went.. no better story to sell you
  fx.1 reveal f_waiting
  fx.2 set flag:waiting_told
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1028.VQ_PAST_FAMILY.d
  t.any.1 Lorna's my sister.. last address was near Radcliff
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1028.VQ_PAST_FAMILY.d2
  t.any.1 Her address is not an invitation to keep asking
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1028.VQ_PAST_FIRSTJOB
  t.any.1 Sweeping Earl's garage.. then he paid me for noticing a bent hinge
  t.any.2 First money bought a gray coat.. thought dark colors made you look experienced
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1028.VQ_PAST_HOBBY
  t.any.1 Choir practice.. something I could finish without sanding
  t.any.2 Liked hearing Lorna find her note.. always acted surprised she had it
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1028.VQ_PAST_HOUSE
  t.any.1 Small rented place outside the gates.. gray wasn't allowed on the walls
  t.any.2 Landlord liked yellow.. lived in a room the color of a warning sign
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1028.VQ_PAST_PARENTS
  t.any.1 Earl fixed cars.. Alma sang alto and kept the collection straight
  t.any.2 Both gone before this.. didn't think I'd ever be glad of a date
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1028.VQ_PAST_REGRET
  gate.rule trust>=70 & alone & flag:waiting_told
  t.any.1 Billed Vern for a new panel.. only repaired the old one.. pocketed the difference for drink.. he'd have lent me money if I'd asked and I stole it instead
  fx.1 reveal f_panel
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1028.VQ_PAST_REGRET.d
  t.any.1 Vern deserves the long answer before a stranger does
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1028.VQ_PAST_REGRET.d2
  t.any.1 Leave the paint bench out of this until I choose to tell it
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1028.VQ_PAST_SCHOOL
  gate.rule trust>=25 & flag:tin_told
  t.any.1 Quit the evening completion course in seventy.. family thought I'd passed.. teacher kept asking if my husband did the garage work.. stopped going and let the certificate story stand
  fx.1 reveal f_school
  fx.2 set flag:school_told
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1028.VQ_PAST_SCHOOL.d
  t.any.1 Evening classes.. doesn't matter to a bent panel
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1028.VQ_PAST_SCHOOL.d2
  t.any.1 School's not a test you're giving me here
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1028.VQ_PAST_WORK
  t.lo.1 Body shop near the post.. panels and paint
  t.mid.1 Earl taught me straightening.. Vern let me do the paint matching
  t.hi.1 Good at the gray nobody else could see was wrong.. less good at taking a compliment
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1028.VQ_TALK_AGE
  t.any.1 Forty-five.. coat's had a harder life
  t.any.2 Old enough to remember every color this coat started as
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1028.VQ_TALK_DISLIKES
  t.any.1 Fresh paint touched by the fellow who asked if it was dry
  t.any.2 A wrench left where rain can get into its joints
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1028.VQ_TALK_FEAR
  t.any.1 Needles.. garage cuts never bothered me the same way
  t.any.2 A clinic tray rattles and I forget every clever thing I was going to say
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1028.VQ_TALK_FOOD
  t.any.1 Potato soup.. Alma put onion in before anybody could object
  t.any.2 Something wrapped for later.. soup's a poor traveler
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1028.VQ_TALK_FROM
  t.any.1 Outside the Fort Knox gates.. civilian side
  t.any.2 Near enough to the post to hear trucks.. never lived by an Army clock
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1028.VQ_TALK_HABIT
  t.any.1 Checking the coat pocket.. pencil keeps escaping
  t.any.2 Looking for the factory edge.. Earl made that a habit
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1028.VQ_TALK_HOPE
  t.any.1 A Guard truck with someone still willing to take a civilian question
  t.any.2 One Wednesday with a room full of people arguing over a hymn number
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1028.VQ_TALK_HOWARE
  t.lo.1 Coat's heavy.. rest of me's still moving
  t.lo.2 Paint under the cuff won't wash out now
  t.mid.1 Dry fit.. looks better before you ask it to hold
  t.mid.2 Keeping the wrench where Earl marked it
  t.mid.3 Still here. No need to polish that answer
  t.mid.4 I've had easier days. You probably have too
  t.mid.5 Better when nobody tries to sell me cheerful
  t.hi.1 Quit counting the gray spots awhile.. that's an improvement
  t.hi.2 Can answer without looking for the exit every time
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1028.VQ_TALK_JOKE
  t.any.1 Vern advertised perfect color matching.. then bought himself a purple door
  t.any.2 Church photographer told the altos to brighten up.. we asked which paint
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1028.VQ_TALK_LIKES
  t.any.1 Matching an awkward gray without having to start over
  t.any.2 Choir when nobody makes me sing the melody
  t.any.3 Getting a color close enough that you stop noticing the repair
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1028.VQ_TALK_MUSIC
  t.any.1 Alto.. let somebody else climb up to the high notes
  t.any.2 Hymns heard through an open kitchen window.. liked them better there
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1028.VQ_TALK_NAME
  t.any.1 Mara Cox.. gray coat's mine
  t.any.2 Cox.. people used to ask for Earl then settle for me
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1028.VQ_TALK_PRAYER
  t.any.1 Still pray.. sometimes over a stubborn screw because that's what I'm doing
  t.any.2 Alma prayed while rinsing bowls.. didn't need a room set aside
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1028.VQ_TALK_QUIET
  t.any.1 Leave the runs.. no need to smooth out every silence
  t.any.2 Quiet's useful.. I can hear myself stop humming
  t.any.3 Yes. A pause doesn't mean something's broken
  t.any.4 Can leave it there a minute. I'll tell you if I want company gone
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1028.VQ_TALK_SLEEP
  t.any.1 Coat folded under me.. saves wondering where the wrench went
  t.any.2 Not much since I left the paint bench
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1028.VQ_TALK_STORY
  t.any.1 Painted Vern's door six times trying to match a sample he'd left in the sun.. seventh time I made him bring the car into shade
  t.any.2 He thanked me in front of three men who'd been explaining paint to me all morning.. didn't say a word about them
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1028.VQ_WORLD_CHURCH
  t.any.1 Haven't seen our Wednesday room since the paint-shop shouting
  t.any.2 Church might have people.. can't sell you that as news
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1028.VQ_WORLD_FAITH
  t.any.1 Prayer helps me finish the question.. doesn't supply an answer
  t.any.2 Alma would have brought a chair for whoever doubted her.. I can manage that much
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1028.VQ_WORLD_GUARD
  t.any.1 Haven't seen the Guard since I left the shop.. would ask if a truck stopped
  t.any.2 No Guard vehicle on my walk.. old gate queues don't tell me what's happening inside now
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1028.VQ_WORLD_NEWS
  t.any.1 People followed Army trucks.. don't know whether they caught them
  t.any.2 Garage road emptied before anybody agreed where to go
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1028.VQ_WORLD_ROAD
  t.any.1 Abandoned cars with doors left wide.. catches your coat passing
  t.any.2 Only know the stretch I walked.. no route clear stamped on it
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1028.leave.angry
  t.any.1 No need to follow.. keep your comments indoors
  t.any.2 Coat's coming with me.. nothing more to settle here
  tag.1 kind:leave
end

node vp_1028.leave.plain
  t.any.1 Coat's coming with me.. don't keep a chair for it
  t.any.2 Time I went looking for those trucks
  tag.1 kind:leave
end

node vp_1028.react.gave_book
  gate.rule gave:book
  t.any.1 I'll keep the paint card for a marker.. not fold your pages
  t.any.2 Hoping it's not another paint formula.. could use something else to read
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1028.react.gave_food
  gate.rule gave:food
  t.any.1 Food.. good to have that settled
  t.any.2 Need to put the wrench aside before I deal with this
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1028.react.gave_water
  gate.rule gave:water
  t.any.1 Water helps.. won't pretend the coat pocket held any
  t.any.2 Thank you.. plain words suit water best
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1028.react.insult
  t.any.1 Heard enough of that in garages.. don't need it here
  t.any.2 Vern heard better insults from dented-car owners
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1028.react.refused
  t.any.1 Then leave it.. I'll ask another kitchen
  t.any.2 A refusal's shorter than explaining my whole coat to me
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1028.react.threat
  t.any.1 Wrench goes down.. no sudden reach from me
  t.any.2 Door's yours.. coat and clipping are mine
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1028.return.arrive
  gate.rule visits>=1
  t.any.1 Gray coat again.. brought no fresh paint
  t.any.2 Found this house without asking at the wrong gate
  tag.1 kind:return
end

node vp_1028.return.gave_food
  gate.rule visits>=1 & gaveever:food
  t.any.1 Haven't forgotten the food.. old coat remembers less useful things
  t.any.2 Remembered where you were when I passed the garage turn
  tag.1 kind:return
end

node vp_1050.VQ_HOUSE_BATH
  t.any.1 Could wash.. can the notebook wait out here?
  t.any.2 Show the right door.. not exploring somebody else's house by mistake
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1050.VQ_HOUSE_CHAIR
  t.any.1 Thanks.. is it alright to set the bag beside it?
  t.any.2 Don't need the best one.. a level seat outranks the dorm desk
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1050.VQ_HOUSE_LIGHTS
  t.any.1 Please leave one.. can't finish the letter by guessing where the lines are
  t.any.2 Enough to see the pen.. not asking you to light the whole street
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1050.VQ_HOUSE_LOCKS
  t.any.1 Can you show me how it opens from inside?
  t.any.2 Not doubting your lock.. need to know the way out if there's shouting
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1050.VQ_HOUSE_RADIO
  t.any.1 Yes.. maybe they're giving something besides the same warning now
  t.any.2 Leave a pencil nearby.. I'll write the place names before we argue what they mean
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1050.VQ_HOUSE_SHELF
  t.any.1 Anything short.. not because I can't read long things.. just tonight
  t.any.2 I'll ask before taking one away from the shelf
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1050.VQ_HOUSE_WELCOME
  t.any.1 Where can the bag go without tripping somebody?
  t.any.2 Won't assume any empty chair's mine.. learned that in the dorm
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1050.VQ_NOW_CARRYING
  gate.rule trust>=10
  t.any.1 Notebook and pen.. brass whistle too.. Granddad left that to Eli and I took it without asking.. called it borrowing so I wouldn't have to say stole
  fx.1 reveal f_whistle
  fx.2 set flag:whistle_told
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1050.VQ_NOW_CARRYING.d
  t.any.1 Bag's mostly paper.. not a treasure hunt
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1050.VQ_NOW_CARRYING.d2
  t.any.1 You asked.. that doesn't mean you can tip it out
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1050.VQ_NOW_FUTURE
  t.any.1 Tomorrow first.. college can stop being the answer to every question
  t.any.2 Would like to carry this bag somewhere without rehearsing an explanation
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1050.VQ_NOW_HUNGRY
  t.lo.1 Yes.. would trade a lecture for a sandwich immediately
  t.lo.2 Bag looks full but paper's a lousy supper
  t.mid.1 Miss the dorm toast.. never expected that confession
  t.hi.1 Hungry enough to quit asking what's in it.. ordinary food I mean
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1050.VQ_NOW_HURT
  t.any.1 Bag strap rubs.. can you check where it's been catching?
  t.any.2 Shoes have lost their argument with the road.. could you check my feet?
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1050.VQ_NOW_PLAN
  t.any.1 Write home.. find someone going toward Rosewood
  t.any.2 Wait for radio instructions that actually mention a place I can reach
  t.any.3 I'd like to get word home before I call anything else a plan
  t.any.4 Not sure yet. You don't have to turn that into a lecture
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1050.VQ_NOW_TIRED
  t.any.1 Tried reading the same page enough times to wear it out
  t.any.2 Could lie down.. brain keeps assigning homework without a teacher
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1050.VQ_NOW_TRUST
  t.lo.1 Checkerboard logic.. haven't seen enough moves yet
  t.mid.1 Could admit a wrong answer here.. not every time but some
  t.hi.1 Bag can stay zipped instead of clutched.. revise that.. I can stop checking the zip
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1050.VQ_NOW_WANT
  t.any.1 A candle or any light I can write by
  t.any.2 Need to finish a letter before I invent a reason not to
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1050.VQ_NOW_WASH
  t.any.1 Yes.. notebook stays somewhere dry first
  t.any.2 Soap if there's enough.. dirt has made this jacket its own property
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1050.VQ_OFFER_BOOK
  t.any.1 Could look first?.. hate promising to finish one just to sound grateful
  t.any.2 Lend me something without an exam at the end
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1050.VQ_OFFER_CANDLE
  t.any.1 Yes.. something steady beside the notebook
  t.any.2 Some light would help if we can arrange it.. don't want to claim anything you've got
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1050.VQ_OFFER_CARDS
  t.any.1 Checkers is safer.. cards let me claim luck too often
  t.any.2 Could try.. don't confuse fast talking with knowing the rules
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1050.VQ_OFFER_FOOD
  t.any.1 Please.. paper bag doesn't have to be full for me
  t.any.2 No lecture about earning it?.. can help after if you need
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1050.VQ_PAST_DAYONE
  t.any.1 In Rosewood packing books.. thought the first shouting was a car wreck
  t.any.2 Mom's list was still on the table.. took my notebook instead
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1050.VQ_PAST_FAMILY
  t.any.1 Mavis and Dean in Rosewood.. Eli's my older brother
  t.any.2 Dad would recognize the crooked bag before he recognized me at a distance
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1050.VQ_PAST_FIRSTJOB
  t.any.1 Shelving.. got told not to stop and read every third cover
  t.any.2 First pay bought this pen's predecessor.. lost it inside a book on payday
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1050.VQ_PAST_HIDING
  gate.rule trust>=70 & alone & flag:interview_told
  t.any.1 Promised Dad I'd call about college.. avoided it while the phone still worked.. said the line was broken once that could finally be my excuse
  cb.1 That call I didn't make.. writing the letter won't turn it into a broken phone
  fx.1 reveal f_phone
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1050.VQ_PAST_HIDING.d
  t.any.1 There's more about home.. let me choose the minute
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1050.VQ_PAST_HIDING.d2
  t.any.1 Stop trying to open the notebook with questions
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1050.VQ_PAST_HOBBY
  gate.rule trust>=25 & flag:whistle_told
  t.any.1 Poems hidden in the arithmetic notebook.. singing story's a dodge.. easier than letting somebody read what I actually wrote
  fx.1 reveal f_poems
  fx.2 set flag:poems_told
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1050.VQ_PAST_HOBBY.d
  t.any.1 Checkers.. you can inspect the whole board
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1050.VQ_PAST_HOBBY.d2
  t.any.1 Notebook stays shut.. find another way to be curious
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1050.VQ_PAST_HOUSE
  t.any.1 Dad's patched screen and Mom's list by the phone
  t.any.2 Dorm had two narrow desks.. Jo Beth claimed the one that didn't wobble
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1050.VQ_PAST_LASTNORMAL
  t.any.1 Arguing about checker rules with Eli.. he used the phrase official buttons
  t.any.2 Mom told us to move the board so supper could be ordinary
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1050.VQ_PAST_PARENTS
  t.any.1 Mom saves every notebook.. sometimes as grocery paper
  t.any.2 Dad says just ask if I need anything.. always makes it sound easy
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1050.VQ_PAST_PROUD
  gate.rule trust>=40 & flag:poems_told
  t.any.1 Valedictorian.. nine in the row though.. only nine graduates.. leave that out around college people.. doesn't erase the work but I still hide it
  cb.1 Nine in the row.. valedictorian of nine graduates.. still leave the nine out when college people ask
  fx.1 reveal f_nine
  fx.2 set flag:nine_told
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1050.VQ_PAST_PROUD.d
  t.any.1 Finished school well.. picture's back home
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1050.VQ_PAST_PROUD.d2
  t.any.1 Don't turn my graduation into another examination
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1050.VQ_PAST_REGRET
  gate.rule trust>=55 & alone & flag:nine_told
  t.any.1 Missed the scholarship renewal interview.. sat outside with Jo Beth's pen instead of admitting I needed help.. then invented a wrong-room story
  fx.1 reveal f_interview
  fx.2 set flag:interview_told
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1050.VQ_PAST_REGRET.d
  t.any.1 College has a longer answer.. not in a room full of listeners
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1050.VQ_PAST_REGRET.d2
  t.any.1 No.. my grades aren't something you get to demand
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1050.VQ_PAST_SCHOOL
  t.any.1 Rosewood first.. then Louisville where a lecture had more people than my whole road
  t.any.2 Took notes like speed could make them make sense later
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1050.VQ_PAST_SIBLING
  t.any.1 Eli's twenty-four.. plays checkers like there's a reward for patience
  t.any.2 Brother can actually carry a tune.. don't tell him I gave him that much
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1050.VQ_PAST_TRAVEL
  t.any.1 Nashville this June.. Eli said I read every sign except our exit
  t.any.2 Louisville felt farther than Nashville.. didn't have my brother choosing the bus
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1050.VQ_PAST_WORK
  t.lo.1 College.. library carts between classes
  t.mid.1 Louisville dorm and shelving books.. paid work was the straightforward part
  t.hi.1 Knew where every book belonged.. liked being certain about at least that
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1050.VQ_TALK_AGE
  t.any.1 Nineteen.. yes I know how old the jacket makes me look
  t.any.2 Turned nineteen before the Nashville trip.. Eli still bought the tickets
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1050.VQ_TALK_DISLIKES
  t.any.1 People reading over the bag while I'm writing
  t.any.2 Being told a lecture's obvious by somebody holding the answer sheet
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1050.VQ_TALK_FEAR
  t.any.1 Everybody deciding I did something before asking.. Rosewood's good at that
  t.any.2 Someone picking up my notebook and saying explain this.. all of it
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1050.VQ_TALK_FOOD
  t.any.1 Mavis makes noodles thick enough to argue with
  t.any.2 Dorm toast.. bad toast but somebody else had to burn it
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1050.VQ_TALK_FROM
  t.any.1 Rosewood.. Louisville for college before summer
  t.any.2 Dorm address wasn't home yet.. kept putting Rosewood on forms
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1050.VQ_TALK_HABIT
  t.any.1 Counting page corners.. need to know nothing fell out
  t.any.2 Whistle cord gets tangled round the pen.. fixing it keeps me occupied
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1050.VQ_TALK_HOPE
  t.any.1 Radio eventually has to explain something.. it can't just keep repeating itself
  t.any.2 A letter can still reach Rosewood if somebody knows where to leave it
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1050.VQ_TALK_HOWARE
  t.lo.1 Fine.. revise that.. bag strap's trying to murder my patience
  t.lo.2 Still better at checkers than walking in these shoes
  t.mid.1 Managed not to lose the notebook.. that counts
  t.mid.2 Would like one question I don't have to guess at
  t.mid.3 Fine. That was the fast answer; I haven't worked out the longer one
  t.mid.4 I keep wanting somebody to tell me what happens next. Annoying, isn't it?
  t.mid.5 You can ask again later. I might have an answer I actually believe
  t.hi.1 Better now the bag can stop being my whole house
  t.hi.2 Actually hearing your question instead of planning a clever answer
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1050.VQ_TALK_JOKE
  t.any.1 Dad repaired the bag strap so well it can pull me over by itself
  t.any.2 Eli says my checker strategy's unfair.. yes that's the point of the strategy
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1050.VQ_TALK_LIKES
  t.any.1 Checkers.. someone can be wrong without it ending the evening
  t.any.2 Library carts with wheels that agree on a direction
  t.any.3 Checkers when nobody lets me win. I can tell, usually
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1050.VQ_TALK_LUCK
  t.any.1 Eli's checker button landed on its edge once.. kept it for the rest of the game
  t.any.2 Lucky things help.. that's not the same as claiming they control the weather
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1050.VQ_TALK_MUSIC
  t.any.1 Went to the Opry in June.. Eli knew when to clap and I copied him
  t.any.2 Not singing anything tonight.. humming an Opry tune's plenty
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1050.VQ_TALK_NAME
  t.any.1 Kayla Clemons.. not the Kay from the store
  t.any.2 Clemons.. Dad says it louder when he's proud
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1050.VQ_TALK_QUIET
  t.any.1 Please.. checkerboard logic isn't helping with this one
  t.any.2 Could do a quiet minute without filling it with notebook facts
  t.any.3 Yeah. We don't have to make it awkward by announcing the silence
  t.any.4 Please stay if you want. I'm not asking you to entertain me
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1050.VQ_TALK_SLEEP
  t.any.1 Every time I close the notebook I think of a better sentence
  t.any.2 Dorm fire alarms were easier.. everybody agreed when to get up
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1050.VQ_TALK_STORY
  t.any.1 Library cart rolled into a lecture while I explained its bad wheel to Jo Beth.. professor asked if the books had enrolled.. said they were auditing.. spent half an hour fetching them from under the seats
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1050.VQ_TALK_TV
  t.any.1 Quiz shows.. Jo Beth banned me from shouting answers before the question finished
  t.any.2 Watched whatever the dorm room next door had loud enough
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1050.VQ_TALK_WEATHER
  t.any.1 Notebook paper curls before my hair does.. that's my forecast
  t.any.2 I was about to complain about July.. don't even know what day it is without asking
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1050.VQ_WORLD_CAUSE
  t.any.1 Had a theory halfway to here.. bag strap broke and I lost my argument
  t.any.2 No experiment in my notebook explains this.. won't pretend a lecture did
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1050.VQ_WORLD_HOPE
  t.any.1 Somebody built a radio to tell people things.. hope somebody's still doing that part
  t.any.2 Would settle for one answer Mom and Dad could hear too
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1050.VQ_WORLD_NEWS
  t.any.1 Rosewood had three versions before anybody reached the radio
  t.any.2 Saw people leaving.. everything about where they went is secondhand
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1050.VQ_WORLD_RADIO
  t.any.1 Same warning last time.. maybe repeating means they're still there
  t.any.2 Could be a recording.. yes.. still worth checking for a change
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1050.VQ_WORLD_ROAD
  t.any.1 Only know the Rosewood way I took.. wouldn't call it open for cars
  t.any.2 Signs can still point correctly with the road blocked.. discovered that slowly
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1050.leave.angry
  t.any.1 Don't read anything I leave by mistake!.. it's still mine
  t.any.2 Leaving with the notebook.. that's all I need to settle
  tag.1 kind:leave
end

node vp_1050.leave.plain
  t.any.1 Bag's together.. I'd better go while I know which way
  t.any.2 If someone heads to Rosewood.. tell them Kayla's trying to leave a letter
  tag.1 kind:leave
end

node vp_1050.react.gave_blanket
  gate.rule gave:blanket
  t.any.1 Didn't have room for this after all the paper.. stupid packing order
  t.any.2 Can fold it small.. Mom would disagree but she's not judging the folds here
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1050.react.gave_book
  gate.rule gave:book
  t.any.1 I'll put it in the good side of the bag
  t.any.2 Library habit says inspect the spine first.. gratitude can go first this time
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1050.react.gave_food
  gate.rule gave:food
  t.any.1 Better than carrying another notebook.. don't tell the library I said that
  t.any.2 This gets a real thank-you.. not a speech with a point
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1050.react.insult
  t.any.1 Could answer that.. revise that.. don't want another round
  t.any.2 No clever reply from me.. doesn't mean I agreed
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1050.react.refused
  t.any.1 No then.. notebook's shut and I'll stop rehearsing a better request
  t.any.2 Can ask somewhere else.. won't argue you into a yes
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1050.react.threat
  t.any.1 Okay.. okay.. pen down and bag shut!
  t.any.2 Won't blow the whistle.. just tell me where to stand
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1050.return.arrive
  gate.rule visits>=1
  t.any.1 Kayla again.. remembered the door without consulting the notebook
  t.any.2 Same crooked bag.. fewer explanations if you'd prefer
  tag.1 kind:return
end

node vp_1050.return.gave_food
  gate.rule visits>=1 & gaveever:food
  t.any.1 Same bag.. haven't forgotten the food you gave me
  t.any.2 Remembered this place as the one where asking worked
  tag.1 kind:return
end

node vp_1059.VQ_HOUSE_BATH
  t.any.1 Wash would help.. won't claim soap can finish what this shirt started
  t.any.2 Yes.. say what water is spare before I get ambitious
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1059.VQ_HOUSE_PRAYER
  t.any.1 A minute would be welcome.. don't need you standing witness
  t.any.2 Yes.. quiet prayer is all, not asking for a room cleared
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1059.VQ_HOUSE_RADIO
  t.any.1 Would listen.. ordinary radio, unless you've actually got a CB set
  t.any.2 Yes.. want to hear where the speaker got the report before believing the report
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1059.VQ_HOUSE_SHELF
  t.any.1 A short mystery might do.. somebody else's missing spoon for a change
  t.any.2 Later, perhaps.. not looking for a book that tells me to be cheerful
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1059.VQ_HOUSE_WELCOME
  t.any.1 Thank you.. won't spread the factory smell beyond where you want me
  t.any.2 Point out a place for the bag.. don't want to occupy half your house by accident
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1059.VQ_NOW_CARRYING
  t.any.1 Notebook and Nolan's aerial.. don't expect either to call him back
  t.any.2 Pack, lighter, useless cap button.. bag's mine even when the contents look foolish
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1059.VQ_NOW_HUNGRY
  t.any.1 Could eat.. not going to grade it against a factory canteen
  t.any.2 Hungry enough to prefer food over a story about where food might be
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1059.VQ_NOW_PLAN
  t.any.1 Keep moving after a rest.. not claiming movement is a cure for anything
  t.any.2 Want to compare what people actually saw near the river.. water on a map isn't a safe road
  t.any.3 Need to think about where I'm going before I borrow somebody else's certainty
  t.any.4 Haven't got a route worth recommending. Mine included
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1059.VQ_NOW_SMOKE
  t.any.1 Yes.. tell me where it's permitted before I light anything
  t.any.2 Smoke.. won't pretend the smell arrived on somebody else's shirt
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1059.VQ_NOW_TIRED
  t.any.1 Last sleep was a broken spell in a room off the road.. couldn't tell you how many hours
  t.any.2 No proper night since leaving the rented room.. too much road in my head
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1059.VQ_NOW_WANT
  t.lo.1 Hat.. something warm that stays on, not a fancy thing
  t.mid.1 A cap would do.. no need to fit a whole new life around my head
  t.hi.1 Still a hat.. plain wool or a work cap, if there's one going spare
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1059.VQ_NOW_WORRY
  gate.rule trust>=25 & alone & flag:lewis_told
  t.any.1 My lungs.. doctor gave the chronic trouble a name in ninety-two.. kept the diagnosis from Lewis.. smoking doesn't make it a clever secret, just one I didn't want him using as the whole explanation for me
  fx.1 reveal f_lungs
  fx.2 set flag:lungs_told
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1059.VQ_NOW_WORRY.d
  t.any.1 A health worry.. no invitation to guess at it
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1059.VQ_NOW_WORRY.d2
  t.any.1 Prefer not to discuss a diagnosis across a room
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1059.VQ_NOW_WORRY.d3
  t.any.1 Enough.. my breathing isn't a debate
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1059.VQ_OFFER_COAT
  t.any.1 If spare, yes.. hat's still what I'm after, but warmth elsewhere counts
  t.any.2 Would try it.. not going to make a fashion complaint with these cuffs
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1059.VQ_OFFER_FOOD
  t.any.1 Yes.. don't need the story dressed up better than the food
  t.any.2 Something plain is fine.. grateful without making a display of it
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1059.VQ_OFFER_SMOKES
  t.any.1 Would take one.. won't light it till you say where
  t.any.2 Thank you.. don't owe me a full pack because you offered a smoke
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1059.VQ_PAST_CHURCH
  gate.rule trust>=55 & alone & flag:aerial_told
  t.hi.1 Went before Nolan died.. lost faith afterward and stayed away.. Mona got me back through the door in ninety-one.. pray again, but won't claim the old certainty came back just because the habit did
  fx.1 reveal f_prayer
  fx.2 set flag:prayer_told
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1059.VQ_PAST_CHURCH.d
  t.any.1 Church near Vine Grove.. attended at different times
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1059.VQ_PAST_CHURCH.d2
  t.any.1 Nolan's death isn't a lesson I'm reciting
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1059.VQ_PAST_CHURCH.d3
  t.any.1 No testing my faith.. conversation ends there
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1059.VQ_PAST_DAYONE
  t.lo.1 At the room I'd been renting.. no shift to report to
  t.mid.1 CB voices arguing over a road before anybody named where the trouble was
  t.hi.1 Tried to write the warning beside an old pack count.. numbers stayed sensible longer than the voices
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1059.VQ_PAST_FAMILY
  t.lo.1 Lewis, my husband.. brother Nolan died in eighty-five
  t.mid.1 No current report on Lewis.. won't borrow somebody else's certainty about a familiar house
  t.hi.1 Mona isn't family on paper.. paper missed several years of third breaks
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1059.VQ_PAST_FIRSTJOB
  t.any.1 Packing at nineteen.. Mother had the lift timed before I knew the driver's name
  t.any.2 First pay bought work shoes.. yes, they charged me to keep standing there
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1059.VQ_PAST_HOBBY
  t.any.1 CB radio.. mostly listening, not making myself a roadside authority
  t.any.2 Radio repairs after work.. Nolan liked a long aerial, I liked a working connection
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1059.VQ_PAST_HOUSE
  t.any.1 Rented near the factory road.. kitchen door and CB handset always tangling each other
  t.any.2 Small house.. Lewis could repair a toaster without getting up from the kitchen table
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1059.VQ_PAST_LASTNORMAL
  t.any.1 Mona asking if I still had her spoon.. a small thing she expected to get back
  t.any.2 Bought a pack and complained about the price.. didn't know what a regular complaint was worth
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1059.VQ_PAST_LOVE
  gate.rule trust>=10
  t.any.1 Lewis.. married in sixty-four, left him in autumn ninety-two.. before the warnings, before I could call leaving an emergency.. didn't explain why I couldn't stay married and made him live with the missing answer
  fx.1 reveal f_lewis
  fx.2 set flag:lewis_told
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1059.VQ_PAST_LOVE.d
  t.any.1 Married Lewis in sixty-four.. that answers the simple part
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1059.VQ_PAST_LOVE.d2
  t.any.1 Marriage isn't a line on your question list
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1059.VQ_PAST_LOVE.d3
  t.any.1 No more about Lewis until I choose it
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1059.VQ_PAST_PARENTS
  t.any.1 Avis, my mother, timed the factory lift with a kitchen timer.. cakes took their chances
  t.any.2 Mother said a regular wage was freedom.. wasn't wrong, wasn't the whole account
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1059.VQ_PAST_PROUD
  gate.rule trust>=70 & alone & flag:prayer_told
  t.hi.1 Mona was cold at a stopping place.. gave her my warm cap and said I had another.. didn't.. that's why I need a hat.. looked better on her anyway
  fx.1 reveal f_cap
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1059.VQ_PAST_PROUD.d
  t.any.1 Keeping the packing line's counts right.. small enough answer for today
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1059.VQ_PAST_PROUD.d2
  t.any.1 Not putting every decent thing on a scale beside the bad ones
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1059.VQ_PAST_PROUD.d3
  t.any.1 Leave Mona out of any bargain about my past
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1059.VQ_PAST_SCHOOL
  t.any.1 Near Vine Grove.. could count fast enough, which is what the factory noticed
  t.any.2 School was local.. Nolan kept every report longer than I kept mine
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1059.VQ_PAST_SIBLING
  t.any.1 Nolan.. four years younger, died in eighty-five.. kept his short aerial
  t.any.2 Brother talked over the CB like every driver owed him an answer.. miss it anyway
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1059.VQ_PAST_TROUBLE
  gate.rule trust>=40 & alone & flag:lungs_told
  t.hi.1 On the CB I claimed to speak for a county road crew.. announced a washed-out turn I'd never seen because I wanted traffic away during a quarrel.. somebody challenged me and I switched off.. trouble was the lie, not a faulty radio
  fx.1 reveal f_aerial
  fx.2 set flag:aerial_told
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1059.VQ_PAST_TROUBLE.d
  t.any.1 Said something foolish over a CB.. not repeating it for company
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1059.VQ_PAST_TROUBLE.d2
  t.any.1 Don't make my old handle a joke around here
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1059.VQ_PAST_TROUBLE.d3
  t.any.1 No demonstration.. that warning doesn't get broadcast twice
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1059.VQ_PAST_WORK
  t.lo.1 Packing line.. laid off in ninety-one when it closed
  t.mid.1 Counted packs, checked wraps.. factory work, not a temporary spell between better jobs
  t.hi.1 Whole line knew the sound before it stopped.. after the layoff I kept waking for a machine that wasn't running
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1059.VQ_TALK_ADVICE
  t.any.1 Check who actually saw the road before believing a confident voice about it
  t.any.2 A person asking for one thing may mean that one thing.. don't improve the request into a sermon
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1059.VQ_TALK_AGE
  t.any.1 Fifty.. got there without the factory sending a card
  t.any.2 Forty-three was the year.. no, that isn't a request for a birthday speech
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1059.VQ_TALK_DISLIKES
  t.any.1 Somebody saying cheer up because silence makes them uncomfortable
  t.any.2 A man borrowing my lighter and testing it fifteen times before giving it back
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1059.VQ_TALK_FEAR
  t.lo.1 Open road with no voice at the other end of it
  t.mid.1 Used to hear drivers on the CB before seeing a truck.. don't like losing that warning
  t.hi.1 Keep saying move along.. fear doesn't stop a person giving herself lousy orders
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1059.VQ_TALK_FOOD
  t.any.1 Mona brought cold fried potatoes.. enough salt to wake the whole table
  t.any.2 Egg sandwich from home.. factory machine sandwiches always tasted of the machine
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1059.VQ_TALK_FROM
  t.any.1 Vine Grove.. factory road, not one of the places with a view
  t.any.2 Near Vine Grove's packing line.. the line shut before the town did
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1059.VQ_TALK_HABIT
  t.any.1 Sorry about the tobacco smell.. say it before someone decides to be polite at me
  t.any.2 Keep checking the bare patch on the shirt.. a name can be missing without a mystery
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1059.VQ_TALK_HOPE
  t.any.1 A warm hat and no explanation owed for wanting it
  t.any.2 Want to hear Mona complain in her own voice.. no current word, before you ask
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1059.VQ_TALK_HOWARE
  t.lo.1 Could use a hat.. go on, have the argument with my head
  t.mid.1 Cold when I stop, hungry when I move.. sorry about the smoke smell
  t.mid.2 Getting by. Don't put me down for anything more impressive
  t.mid.3 Could use fewer questions with a right answer hidden in them
  t.mid.4 Company's helping. There, said it before I could take it back
  t.hi.1 Not measuring this stop against a factory break anymore.. can let an answer take its time
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1059.VQ_TALK_LIKES
  t.any.1 Listening on a CB without having to answer every voice
  t.any.2 Fixing a loose radio connection.. a small fault beats a mysterious one
  t.any.3 A voice on the CB that says what it means and gets off the channel
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1059.VQ_TALK_MUSIC
  t.any.1 Low country radio.. music, not somebody shouting a price through the song
  t.any.2 Mona hummed while screwing the thermos shut.. usually preferred that to the radio
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1059.VQ_TALK_NAME
  t.any.1 Sharon Hubbard.. patch used to say it before I took the patch off
  t.any.2 Hubbard.. don't bother looking for the name on the shirt
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1059.VQ_TALK_PRAYER
  t.any.1 Still pray.. don't offer anybody a guarantee with it
  t.any.2 Yes.. quiet is fine, don't need a person checking how sincerely
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1059.VQ_TALK_QUIET
  t.any.1 Quiet's worth having.. don't need to make friends with it out loud
  t.any.2 Fine.. won't mistake it for an invitation to tell every story I've got
  t.any.3 Quiet's fine. You needn't apologize for not having a speech ready
  t.any.4 A little company without the questions would suit me
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1059.VQ_TALK_SLEEP
  t.any.1 Not enough.. every exposed bit of road seems to follow me into sleep
  t.any.2 Third break used to be enough rest.. body wants to file a complaint about that now
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1059.VQ_TALK_STORY
  t.mid.1 Mona's red thermos fell into a packing box.. line chief signed for it as machine parts
  t.hi.1 Mona's red thermos once traveled two bays labeled machine parts.. she made the chief sign it back before third break
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1059.VQ_TALK_WEATHER
  t.any.1 Maybe rain.. short aerial isn't a weather instrument, despite what Nolan claimed
  t.any.2 July can still leave you cold after walking wet.. don't need a forecast to know that
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1059.VQ_WORLD_NEWS
  t.any.1 CB gave me noise and an old warning.. nothing current I can stand behind
  t.any.2 No fresh report.. hearing a thing twice doesn't give it a second witness
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

